invariant: INV-16
file: widemul.h
catches: widemul_runtime_test
reason: widemul_native runs the native copies for every byte but
  WIDEMUL_NOT_STATED, so a direction whose answer was never written, 0,
  runs the native multiply on its key. No session passes such a byte but
  a wiped direction, and the dispatchers must not depend on that
  (widemul.h). bin/widemul_runtime_test runs every operation under 0, 3,
  0x80 and 0xff and requires the decomposition.

--- old
    return widemul == WIDEMUL_CONSTANT_TIME;
--- new
    return widemul != WIDEMUL_NOT_STATED;
